# 只让镜像拿到「源码 + 依赖清单」，其余一律不进构建上下文。
# 尤其是 photos/（原始素材，绝不能进镜像层）与本机的 node_modules。
# Only source and manifests reach the image. photos/ (original material) and the
# host's node_modules must never enter a layer.

.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
photos
dist
# 不能整体排除 spec/：Dockerfile 要 COPY spec/v5/contracts/v5-contracts.json，
# 一旦排除，构建上下文里就没有契约文件，docker build 会直接失败。
# *.md 已排除所有文档，spec/ 下只剩少量 JSON 在上下文里；只有被显式
# COPY 的文件才会进入镜像层。
# Do not exclude spec/ wholesale: the Dockerfile COPYs the V5 contract JSON,
# and excluding it would break docker build. *.md already drops the docs;
# only a few JSONs remain in the context, and only explicitly COPYed files
# ever land in an image layer.
**/.DS_Store
android
scripts
*.md
!src/server/*.md
